     "content": "SAC v0.1 supplies a conditional active classical LC simulator contract. zprime=F0+a+r and aprime=omega*(command-a)+xi. Uniform command tracking bounded by max(initial mismatch,K*(M*age+input error)+command error+actuator distortion+K*M/omega). Example period and latency each <=1/400000, pole>=400000, input error<=1e-6, command and actuator errors<=1e-5, initial tracking<=1e-3. Total residual 145267/16000000 below 1/100. Conditional ten-time-constant preload bounds release tracking by 4391/8000000; normalized output range 10 suffices. Ideal 22-bit quantization only one error contribution. Exact controls and source-bound Gauss integration pass. Hardware model identification, calibrated physical rates and non-constructor review OPEN. No experiment or full campaign/SDW/physical admission."
