e record <span>⌕</span></a></header><main id="main"><div class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">20 October 2026 UTC · SAC v0.1</div><h1>A sampled controller with an actuator budget.</h1><p class="lede">CD-1 now has a conditional implementation contract for sampling, finite bandwidth, startup and output range.</p></div>
